Description: EVE Online window manager for KDE Plasma
 FleetCommander (fcwm) arranges EVE Online client windows on KDE Plasma 6
 (Wayland and X11): grid layouts, profiles, window stacks, global hotkeys
 and live previews, controlled through a local web UI.
 .
 It talks to KWin via D-Bus (busctl) and KWin scripts, and uses
 kwriteconfig6/kreadconfig6 and kscreen-doctor. An X11 fallback backend
 without KWin uses wmctrl, xdotool and xrandr.
